  "body": "Offering space, flexibility, and excellent outdoor living, this four-bedroom home suits families looking for room to spread out, with the added benefit of separate accommodation options.\r\n\r\nArranged over two levels, the home provides a practical layout with plenty of possibilities.\r\nOn the ground floor, you will find two bedrooms including a separate lounge and kitchenette, with direct access to the outdoor entertaining area. Ideal for extended family, guests or teenagers wanting their own space. The outdoor area is a real highlight, with generous decking, a solar-heated saltwater swimming pool, and plenty of room to entertain or simply relax.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the main living area comprises two bedrooms, an open-plan kitchen and living space, plus two separate conservatories. These additional rooms offer great flexibility for a second sitting area, home office, hobbies or extra living space.\r\nEnjoy a north-facing aspect with sea views across Army Bay, while the fully fenced section provides privacy and practicality.\r\nParking is another major advantage, with a double garage, a new double carport and plenty of additional off-street parking.\r\n\r\nProperty features include:\r\n* Four bedrooms over two levels\r\n* Separate downstairs two-bedroom accommodation with lounge and kitchenette \r\n* Direct outdoor access from the downstairs living area\r\n* Saltwater swimming pool \r\n* Solar Panel that services upper level and swimming pool\r\n* Generous outdoor decking and entertaining space\r\n* Two upstairs bedrooms\r\n* Open-plan kitchen and living\r\n* Two separate conservatories\r\n* North-facing sea views across Army Bay\r\n* Fully fenced section\r\n* Double garage and new double carport\r\n* Excellent off-street parking\r\n\r\nA versatile property offering multiple living options, generous outdoor space and a sought-after coastal outlook.",
